      "type": "operator_map",
      "title": "Skånetrafiken, Malmö C terminal map (June 2026)",
      "note": "Supplied by the owner; used to place exits, stairs and lifts, not copied."
    },
    {
      "type": "website",
      "url": "https://www.jernhusen.se/hitta-din-station/malmo-centralstation/karta-over-stationen/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-22",
      "note": "Jernhusen's station map of Malmö C (January 2026 PDF): shop units, names and outlines from the PDF's own vector shapes, placed by fitting them to OpenStreetMap's shop pins (median 4.7 m off). Not ODbL: Jernhusen hasn't licensed the plan; see data/stations/README.md."
    }
  ],
  "changelog": [
    {
      "date": "2026-10-22",
      "who": "Claude (for the owner)",
      "what": "First draft from OSM (2026-10-19 extract): City Tunnel platforms from their layer, 4 hand connections for platform heads 3 for the west exit and 4 lifts at the middle and east exits, placed from Skånetrafiken's terminal map (June 2026) supplied by the owner."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-10-22",
      "who": "Claude (for the owner)",
      "what": "Shops, cafés, restaurants and services from Jernhusen's January 2026 station map, with their outlines (31 places); Oak berry and Gottelisa, no longer on it, removed."
    }
  ],
